  "reviewed": [
    "Actual complete bounded HTTP 410 with integer ProblemDetail.status and exact codes; private final typed evidence bound to original key/path; redirects rejected",
    "Parent API captures scoped epoch before first await and rechecks after token, persistence barrier and HTTP response; before-step-up requests cannot revive",
    "Origin/issuer-bound physical slots, AES-GCM namespace/request AAD, non-deleting corruption handler and lost key/database initialization witness",
    "Native transaction CAS enforces immutable request/payload, success false-to-true and EXPIRED-to-ERASED only; atomic finish writes minimal marker and deletes only the exact pending record",
    "Finish receipt matches exact expected request digest, reason and known-success state; capacity/storage/crypto failures retain the pending fence",
    "Confirmation owns its route, safely removes itself under cover, closes on owner pop/deactivate/access loss and rechecks positive callback; current-record reading does not require finishing local check"
  ],
  "closedFindings": [
